s, and background placement when those areas enter frame. Do not use <Video 1> for characters or current camera framing.  [Shot 1] Live-action cinematic, The scene starts in the tavern's wooden floor. Stage this segment as one continuous camera take with no cuts or cutaways; reframe only through continuous camera movement. Preserve each established handheld or movable prop as one distinct physical object; interactions must not duplicate, merge, or substitute containers or other props.

